    "The saved OSM circular platform, pedestal plans and elevations control the model. The shaft reaches 37 m, the capital platform 38 m and the overall landmark 46.3 m.",
    "The column shaft is kept circular and green-patinated. Its rings, capital ornaments and pedestal medallions are schematic; inscriptions and individual Corinthian leaves are omitted.",
